+    ("src/private_block/run_capture.rs", RUN_CAPTURE_RS):
+        "[TINYLLAMA PORT v11, round 8] read against `aaff4e6e` (the token r7c writer, "
+        "read in round 7: the native writer 1d43d68c plus the token capture hooks, "
